## Lore

A "normal" high school student or college freshman with little in the way of
adventuring skills at the time of the Becoming. This package applies to most
teenage Nightbane and to those created in a Dark Day Campaign.

It is one of four skill packages for the Nightbane R.C.C. The packages are
guidelines: a Game Master may allow skills outside them for a convincing
reason, and a character who later joins a Faction may be allowed to pick new
skills from that Faction''s package as he progresses in level.

Hand to hand training here applies only to the Facade. Most Nightbane fight
with combat abilities equal to basic martial arts in their Morphus shape - an
innate, instinctual ability.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nb-package-basic');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nb-package-basic';

